ription":"Reviewer action; `delete` is accepted as an alias for `discard`.","enum":["attest","update","invalidate","discard","delete"],"type":"string"},"actor":{"description":"Attribution actor.","enum":["agent","harness","user","system"],"type":"string"},"bank":{"description":"Isolation key; overrides the connection default when present.","type":"string"},"item_id":{"description":"Target memory item id.","type":"string"},"new_content":{"description":"Corrected value; required for `update`.","type":"string"},"note":{"description":"Reviewer observation; required non-empty for update/invalidate/discard.","type":"string"}},"required":["item_id","action"],"type":"object"},"name":"validate","tool":"validate"},{"description":"Read-only memory counts by bank, tier, and category.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"actor":{"description":"Attribution actor.","enum":["agent","harness","user","system"],"type":"string"},"bank":{"description":"Isolation key; overrides the connection default when present.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"stats","tool":"stats"},{"description":"Read-only ranked noise scan: candidates by descending hygiene_noise_score with masked previews; never mutates memory.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"actor":{"description":"Attribution actor.","enum":["agent","harness","user","system"],"type":"string"},"bank":{"description":"Isolation key; overrides the connection default when present.","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Ranked page size, 1..=200 (default 50).","type":"number"},"min_score":{"description":"Rank floor in 0.0..=1.0 (default 0.40).","type":"number"},"offset":{"description":"Offset into the ranked candidate list.","type":"number"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"hygiene_audit","tool":"hygiene_audit"},{"description":"Confirmed cleanup: flag | archive | discard (delete alias, non-compliance) | keep (apply each candidate's suggested_action). Without confirm=true: dry-run counts only, zero writes. Never performs compliance erasure or DEK destruction.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"description":"Requested action; `delete` is the documented non-compliance alias of `discard`.","enum":["flag","archive","discard","delete","keep"],"type":"string"},"actor":{"description":"Attribution actor.","enum":["agent","harness","user","system"],"type":"string"},"bank":{"description":"Isolation key; overrides the connection default when present.","type":"string"},"candidates":{"description":"Prior hygiene_audit candidates (item_id + noise_score + suggested_action).","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"item_id":{"type":"string"},"noise_score":{"type":"number"},"suggested_action":{"enum":["flag","archive","discard"],"type":"string"}},"required":["item_id"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"confirm":{"description":"Perform the mutations; default false (dry-run counts only).","type":"boolean"},"item_ids":{"description":"Bare item ids (alternative to candidates).","items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"note":{"description":"Review note persisted on flag.","type":"string"},"reason":{"description":"Non-empty removal reason for confirmed discard.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"hygiene_clean","tool":"hygiene_clean"},{"description":"Masked durable hygiene-log rows (one row per item per clean action); every cleanup is reconstructible without secret leakage.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"actor":{"description":"Attribution actor.","enum":["agent","harness","user","system"],"type":"string"},"bank":{"description":"Isolation key; overrides the connection default when present.","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Page size, 1..=200 (default 50).","type":"number"},"offset":{"description":"Page offset.","type":"number"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"hygiene_log_list","tool":"hygiene_log_list"},{"description":"Write one JSON memory_export_bundle with a completeness_manifest (version, counts, checksums, filter, complete flag). content_mode defaults to dsar_plaintext (authorized readable export); ciphertext_backup emits opaque bodies without DEKs. Requires a harness/system actor; no DEKs, API keys, or sync credentials in the file.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"category":{"description":"Semantic category filter (narrowed exports mark complete=false).","type":"string"},"content_mode":{"description":"dsar_plaintext (default) | ciphertext_backup.","type":"string"},"destination":{"description":"File path for the bundle JSON.","type":"string"},"include_archived":{"description":"Include hygiene-archived rows (default true).","type":"boolean"},"include_discarded":{"description":"Include operationally discarded rows (default true).","type":"boolean"},"time_end":{"description":"created_at upper bound (exclusive).","type":"string"},"time_start":{"description":"created_at lower bound (inclusive).","type":"string"}},"required":["destination"],"type":"object"},"name":"export","tool":"export"},{"description":"Idempotent, manifest-validated JSON import of a prior export. Re-importing the same bundle skips everything (would_skip); force=true overwrites differing rows with an auditable reason. Every new long-term row passes the admission gates; dry_run reports counts without writing.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"dry_run":{"description":"Report would-create/skip/reject/overwrite without writing.","type":"boolean"},"force":{"description":"Overwrite differing existing rows (requires reason).","type":"boolean"},"reason":{"description":"Audit reason required when force=true.","type":"string"},"source":{"description":"File path of the bundle to import.","type":"string"}},"required":["source"],"type":"object"},"name":"import","tool":"import"},{"description":"Provider importer: import memories from external memory providers (Mem0 supported; other providers return PROVIDER_IMPORT_UNSUPPORTED). Dry-run report precedes writes. Credentials are masked in all output.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"credentials":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"Provider credentials (masked in all logs and reports; never plaintext).","type":"object"},"dry_run":{"description":"Plan and produce dry-run report with zero writes.","type":"boolean"},"options":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"Provider options (api_base_url, user_id, agent_id, page_size, max_items).","type":"object"},"provider":{"description":"Provider name (mem0 | hindsight | mnemosyne | honcho | supermemory).","type":"string"}},"required":["provider"],"type":"object"},"name":"import_provider","tool":"import_provider"},{"description":"Read-only whole-store install/database health snapshot: backend reachability, schema version, banks, index coverage counts, and embedding readiness. Never mutates memory and takes no bank scope.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"timestamp":{"description":"Snapshot time; defaults to now.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"diagnose","tool":"diagnose"},{"description":"Deeper read-only consistency pass over referential integrity and index coverage; aggregate ok is false when any error-severity finding exists.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bank":{"description":"Bank scope; whole store when omitted.","type":"string"},"timestamp":{"description":"Report time; defaults to now.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"verify","tool":"verify"},{"description":"Compose an ordered repair plan from verify findings. Default dry_run=true prints the plan and registers nothing; dry_run=false registers the plan and returns its id without touching the store.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bank":{"description":"Bank scope; whole store when omitted.","type":"string"},"dry_run":{"description":"Print the plan only (default true); false registers a concrete plan id.","type":"boolean"},"timestamp":{"description":"Composition time; defaults to now.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"doctor","tool":"doctor"},{"description":"Apply allowlisted repairs from a doctor plan id or an explicit action list. confirm=true is required to mutate; unknown actions are refused and successful runs re-verify and report residual findings.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"actions":{"description":"Explicit allowlisted action ids (used when plan_id is omitted).","items":{"description":"One allowlisted action id.","type":"string"},"type":"array"},"bank":{"description":"Bank scope; required for explicit actions (or when the plan carries none). Without a bank every action fails with no mutation.","type":"string"},"confirm":{"description":"Perform the repairs; default false (refused).","type":"boolean"},"plan_id":{"description":"Doctor-returned plan id to apply.","type":"string"},"timestamp":{"description":"Repair time; defaults to now.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"repair","tool":"repair"},{"description":"Rebuild derived dense and/or lexical indexes. dry_run=true (default) reports scope and cost only; a mutating run requires confirm=true and an embedding sidecar for the dense leg.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bank":{"description":"Bank scope; every indexable bank when omitted (rejected over MCP while the shared bank surface is disabled).","type":"string"},"confirm":{"description":"Perform the rebuild; default false.","type":"boolean"},"dry_run":{"description":"Report scope/cost only (default true).","type":"boolean"},"target":{"description":"Which derived indexes to rebuild (default all).","enum":["dense","lexical","all"],"type":"string"},"timestamp":{"description":"Report time; defaults to now.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"reindex","tool":"reindex"},{"descript